{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1396,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52e0ced13bec92c08b6eb7c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦，快快开始吧！……呵呵，\r\n光看你的表情我就大概\r\n知道你打算做什么训练了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fc33827fc9cce338073c29de84693bc818abfe2939846f22b9ed616c5ad4093",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd06d1762349b4f0c55938bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "沙滩真是个好地方呢！\r\n要是在这里举办比赛或活动\r\n一定会超级热闹的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7849b88d4a2045fc41c48266955d6d4f04b7b3a3c3d2704e681a6d29ec70ac38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e80beac3aba95b99431e2eec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この衣装でいたら注目の的だね♪\r\nってなったら、全力でやって、\r\nいいとこ見せるっきゃないっしょ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ea53c5beeb58384a00066f62f08fd54fbdd3dee669de0f6f039344c84b46ad1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6333f259215de80c40d716f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんなトレーニングでもやるよ～！\r\n夜空を駆けるように、\r\n走っていっちゃうもんね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec6265db2e3c91a9f7623af3cb10f7863b1810c16af34f7349f0d659e17b7e1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a404cdbeb7a89edd54cd30c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よい子にしか、いいクリスマスは\r\nやってこない…トレーナーさん\r\nご指導お願いします！…なんてね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3211b9cb31aabe455229fc182bd192c7353378d98687706e513320c49103ed84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3690467c0fafa1fdf302836a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "裏地の色が緑でさ。風受けると\r\n白と緑がなびいて…メジロ！\r\nって感じになるんだ！見たい？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7ffe7b83f8bc7c2581b417f43a4ab7d4ce5df4aef3f6becf3c8fb1d36a7d2b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e9befc061f6a36116f0e96a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなを盛り上げたいなら…\r\n私が率先してアガってかないとね！\r\nお手本見せてあげますか～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30e8e644bedab63c7f82974afd0c40438253993a6825385dbf5522f55078b6e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27faf6f77a1db5eb51095ea9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ほらトレーナー、盛り上がってこ！\r\nトレーニングは2人でやるもの…\r\n私だけってのも寂しいでしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aabcd7a0a8551acfc6201f8eb3a3927bf6605c314bbacce68635cd3d334d4aee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b83386931920ddbc291209f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私らのノリで学園中の\r\nトレーニング、楽しくアゲてこー！\r\n大丈夫！2人でならできるって！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2fcc70be25875a5ad9adecff6e2757fb3cc3e7fb88a03f7c6262f5e6fc32fd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fcfc9f055d5cba8c3d3be46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们可是最＆棒的组合，对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78abc49fba0970f7d54573f62e25e2c66de31801ef41044512e79d7ffbb1ca6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:636afff41a66bfc427812b10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你就大方地自称神训练员吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ac235f88666887921a5fb5c9ccdee78362dfcf4974f88ae57ba7450bfdfdee2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4130311f8a393782ca9446e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私らの勝利を祝して…乾杯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2d8aaa297e5889bbc63390b0dd885c4785de80aa7152cbebab9a3df2d5d3ff0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c0a1b2b15c712ce056284ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "サンタとトナカイくらい、\r\nいいコンビだったよね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82be89a6ab5ce090f7f4bd7780a358beeeb885eb80ff5f5622450475a92cbbbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01790bd25f585c48d31dea45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ドリンクでお客さんをアゲればアゲるほど\r\n報酬もアガる…と。これは頑張らないとね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "34c4211a9372cd88c194e093e3bf1168f255bfe8609b58fd5e12460227c4acb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "940000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:716e3920d407370d745b50f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れ様！　フェス終わったらお礼、受け取ってね♪\r\nもらい忘れちゃったらほら…『ぴえん』だから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "970d27fd5cea60886ec5600f549edc325ad87c0ef673b7a89fe70151879b787e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "940001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18033045bb6008858d1c455e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来才是重头戏吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98221368fa120beee0e4260f7a5080c6fe44cc62dbb51a34400d201457882699",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a3244549b364070c38a6476",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样就可以更自由的奔跑了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51b0de65060f8aaf7e88cec8074aabd8d908d99eef72e791daaa5a6b15938e8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a34b90abc4424e5f9e9c79d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是目白善信。多关照啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27425d5e04bd6b16ffe9d8c02378a6476527ba8a1bc8e5dcf9bf2401ccaaf52f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eabbd9b53a6712e58f1f999",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "超高速领头！爆速领头！\r\n神速领头啊啊啊啊──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da535047dc8e7dec43cf9a770e0027205c37455cbf1d635ca6dbd72c305b6d05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:908f78060be9705fe29478f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，轮到善信出场了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "880a5c3ff63b9f78c95375efa2934a59955a7afd4a9fc1c39bce6cbd602b9549",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:309cef3a816b63ec9f68e3c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2edec37b213947ef8236d61211075fff3f9778331345b60d33c83388ec1b349",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f536f6c2d0639c3eaa7c2ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もっと盛り上げられるね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "697b84975b2f0631b1a11335684b3b8a0dadf0d4693ee77e0107d13b697a9b13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a41b686b4529cf125f5a9d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "限界超えてからが、\r\n本当のパーティーってね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "498e4000bc9108124c103a3d8f799d01c633656f58b9fed65bdc62e6cec0e27e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b19074e8c64f3aaad7a33006",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アガるクリパをお望み～？\r\nパーマーさんにまっかせなさい♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e2287ede0f6a3e65953ed57fa47b33bf21c3a931146ff389a07ac8b3e8ecd05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64fe2fabb98c2c71b337a521",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よいちょー！メジロパーマーだよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "927d5b49a36d44049a3d3f7ae15d0adf264047c28bc9b27bfc50ab17470afd48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b93927ca810448426198803f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上啰，fu～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f2fa5d166eab8698df2a44fade3b8cc4322c2deeac64129fe933cc3e7b77a52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cef6700d5620b09ea7e0308",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每天都开心到MAX！\r\n不过居然还能再更嗨，真是吓死我！\r\n阿训果然很神～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b941e97d77527a6232481f77a0757642cc522f5175817c8e3caeabbdff9e8833",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6cc29b2438dfdff8912b454",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくんねー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e992b661980cfdc645293714d6dcb74716c24bc66579c780a165c1440c12bbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaae87fa39b14247a4dd3c86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9d600edd4c987f3247b3090a622080abe8e88308dcf78eded0477be4bf5d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2f7692f2f59d839df10fa2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿训训来陪陪我吧～！\r\n总之先拍有趣影片？然后可以\r\n去唱歌～闲聊～喝珍奶之类的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30129ee6bfcc4cf530e5b1e7eaf92814d6b6bd582de4ea4ef01e4bf9415f9531",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95e4fede21676ccd2c041b29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿训～今天要嗨一波吗！？\r\n轮到DJ太阳神～和派对咖阿训登场！\r\n非上不可吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2390561079782818774b7aba80df2557dd813c41cc3bd2dc45166dccffd2c8d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e06b16facdac8ae0a1ead6a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿训，吃过年糕汤了吗！？\r\n这是我跟小小花一起做的！\r\n要来一口新年的味道吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d67208ac7de1f46ca78d561c0df31a4b87789dd8d7e73d2ee708cf5c95caed3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ef9d5bc2f4ceeabd08caac0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你听我说～我昨天跟姐妹们一起\r\n做了肖像巧克力！结果……\r\n全都太Q了！舍不得吃啊～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "559db20ed4f303fafb1e7e5ffb22b963a54496b5ffba60e1dcf9c3184a06c689",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b99c85353d6f1eb2755f7e94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节喔耶～♪\r\n我当然也有替阿训准备礼物！\r\n升天小阳阳MAX增量巧克力☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c9000e7dd9f2ec2a5d40ef62f06d14469ec97b05be7559c3a0ac89138d77db2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40d997ecefd53fa9d3d5e31e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小织和小郎今天要约会喔耶～！\r\n一年只能见一次面也太哭哭了吧。\r\n我会想和喜欢的人黏在一起～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "281593171c6fb14f3d1610cdd54b03ee4e0d0c64da467d254460fd5e9cf97302",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:112647d125b5d7c1082d7daa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小训！快看UG！\r\n我和城市一起打扮成殭尸女孩！\r\n殭尸妆赞到爆啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "acb65a9e7b0e12ab45b7cc0278f352273ba89678492a4eab7f5cea3f9ece970f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d8de288873addc21751d248",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿训训，快来帮忙～！\r\n我想和素质扮成双胞胎圣诞老人！\r\n总之先来执行捕捉素质作战吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6c850b72ec5cbbce2c6c0d027c1044055e0b9254eb45105a6de0cb9d0596c86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f53b7369417336f934e59ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦！？今天没有排行程吗！？\r\n太幸运了☆和我一起去看灯饰吧！\r\n叮叮当～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32e5e6ca215244f26588567a5af547d381cfd6fc3cb916be4273d27195c04911",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:516814754d6ca0eb5b053d48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Fu～！大家最棒了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3683edc27f8eb5cbea6aa318478f9cbfa8cfe592ab6192311f8cb1de113ef1d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13e165fa18f3ee8d04efb7fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要跟姐妹们们一起跨年倒数！\r\n佐敦说会帮忙挑披萨和饮料！\r\n她真的太神了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52ed08c227017bd09f91206484f831babcb8de92dae088450372bbe880ce1b2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bbaed3ca83766d20db007b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿训训生快～～！\r\n来办庆生派对吧☆\r\n做个汽水塔！大闹一场吧～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7be412384c1aa775943ed48f63210868c0d361fabe2da131625f5ddff09b1a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6e33dd5e3ccfd36d18c498f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日礼物是～小阳阳特制蛋糕！\r\n上面的装饰是我们的脸！\r\n色彩鲜艳的阿训，很可爱吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "79562e0cffff92d28e5c5e07a0eedf2a5d5d529ad037089a4705d4ed67b0f268",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfaebaf72806112e30968b95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到善信送的生日礼物，好开熏～！\r\n是我超想要的饰品耶！\r\n好麻吉之力太让人感动了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22f2fa73dabc02d3427ffac597391a4ab624549566faf589ca7ca411b5a7f4fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abcb2b4d010da16ee84af7b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸～欸～！\r\n你可以当我的庆生派对主持人吗！？\r\n果然只有阿训才能胜任啊☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "58400b059243ff91aadb28c00ee54b96a5c35cc37446ef46eadee6fc18a0da88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fa8c2a06013666b6cda23ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新公告？\r\n快快看完＆快快回复吧～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a00ebcbfc260402c889dc445d9afa7864295a66bad43501c76d18d63a7329b5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0e416f4b2efdf29db7099a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔耶～！有礼物！\r\n太令人开熏了～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81244cfc2ba40489037b8343a157e9166e6271780486d699449a7cb8fb3e589a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f567a00f4bc1c9ffa4584f4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咻～达成任务了！\r\n真不愧是小训训☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c9e7a820d7dac30221ff463da2ac3ebfb0a1df805505cb53276d70a9564832c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddb7b9a02c33b6f8fddd9ed2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动要开始了！？嗨起来～！\r\n我等不及了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8be426df087ff024b53c0d2a875069c7f525c7db6ddc900b72960983281c911e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88556602653b0451ac87dfad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿训训，快点过来♪\r\n一起来参加活动狂嗨吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c230941f912cc6759865a5bc008757d8d972ec931ab9c1587c20554193c109d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23ef543c071168480f59ef70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔喔！太不甘心了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77795fe98a1e799f655f44908f30a3924cc39f3249d0da230f1c5322cb76120b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e4b79a98ff78643900b17a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册等级提升了耶！\r\n继续不断提升吧～！",
